          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/0",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "blind_spots: Common failure modes include small samples, no pre-registered baseline, hindsight leakage from later-revised data, adoption failure, and no measurement of changed decisions.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/0/claim/51",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/0",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "blind_spots: Success is judged by prediction accuracy rather than by changed decisions and downstream wins, so a tool could be accurate and still add nothing.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
