        "PitchSeqSelfScout cubs_existing_sequence_audit",
        "CrossLeagueNorm minor_league_rule_regime_effect_sizes",
        "CrossLeagueNorm public_milb_park_factor_quality",
        "CallUpCalibration_vs_CrossLeagueNorm overlapping scope and shared data dependency, which suggests merging them and testing once",
        "OppBullpenForecast forecast_accuracy_vs_naive_rule",
