        "BlindSpots cubs_internal_analytics_capabilities",
        "BlindSpots supplied_evidence_records_for_any_candidate",
        "DecisionSnapshotBacktestHarness Build a frozen as-of-date public-data archive and a scoring harness that tests any of these six predictions against simple baselines. Users are analysts, the decision is which tool deserves staff time, and the intervention is an evaluation framework rather than a product."
