          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Callup-calibration: a retrospective test is feasible: for each past league-season, use only data through the promotion date, predict MLB outcomes after promotion, and compare against a simple baseline (raw wRC+ or ERA with a fixed level discount). Check calibration of the intervals, not just point error. Selection bias applies because only promoted players have MLB outcomes.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
