          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/2",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Shared-blind-spot: none establishes the Cubs' current process, staff size, or error history, and these are UNKNOWN. A tool built without that is guessing about the need.",
