          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Shared-blind-spot: the set mostly covers analysts, front office and coaches. It barely covers amateur and international scouting, strength and conditioning, mental performance, and clubhouse or equipment operations. Draft and trade valuation, contract or free-agent decisions, and minor-league logistics beyond promotion are largely absent.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
