          "text": "SEQ_SELFSCOUT - Looks useful but isn't: an entropy chart with no link to runs, or a flagged pattern that is really a pitch-quality or situational artifact.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/31",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "UNKNOWN",
          "text": "SEQ_SELFSCOUT - evidence_linking_sequence_entropy_to_run_prevention, cubs_existing_sequence_audit.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
