        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/32",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "MILB_CONTEXT_NORM - Problem plausibility: league and park differences are real and the comparison recurs. But public sites partly adjust already, and overlap with CALLUP_TRANSLATOR is large, so it is arguably one project.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/33",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "MILB_CONTEXT_NORM - Data: public stats and rule-change dates are lawful and usable. Rule-regime effects are confounded with talent and call-up churn, and single league-seasons give few samples.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/34",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "MILB_CONTEXT_NORM - Actionability: staff would alter promotion timing or prospect ranking only if the adjustment moves players across decision thresholds.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/35",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "MILB_CONTEXT_NORM - Testability: test whether adjusted stats predict later performance better than raw stats, using players who move between leagues or rule regimes as natural checks. Baselines are raw stats and simple park factors.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/36",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "MILB_CONTEXT_NORM - Alternatives: public park factors, league-level adjusted metrics, and likely internal models.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/37",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "MILB_CONTEXT_NORM - Looks useful but isn't: over-fit regime coefficients from tiny samples, or adjustments that change values trivially next to the noise.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/38",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "UNKNOWN",
          "text": "MILB_CONTEXT_NORM - minor_league_rule_regime_effect_sizes, public_milb_park_factor_quality.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/39",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "OPP_BULLPEN - Problem plausibility: reliever usage affects lineup and pinch-hit choices daily. But opposing managers' choices also depend on private warm-up, health and front-office information.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/40",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "OPP_BULLPEN - Data: public box scores and pitch counts are lawful and available before game time, but they omit unrecorded warm-ups and injuries, which the Cubs would not see either.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/41",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "OPP_BULLPEN - Actionability: a lineup or pinch-hit change must follow from a forecast. Often a manager already assumes the opponent's best relievers are used when needed, so the forecast may change little.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/42",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "OPP_BULLPEN - Testability: strong. Predict which relievers appear using only the prior-day data and compare against naive rules such as \"rested if not used yesterday\". Score by log loss or Brier score. Then test whether any decisions would have differed.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/43",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "OPP_BULLPEN - Alternatives: advance scouts, public usage trackers and likely club tools.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/44",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "OPP_BULLPEN - Looks useful but isn't: high forecast accuracy that merely reproduces the naive rule, or accuracy on easy cases only.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/45",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "UNKNOWN",
          "text": "OPP_BULLPEN - forecast_accuracy_vs_naive_rule, unobserved_bullpen_warmups_effect.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/46",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "BLINDSPOTS - Shared assumption: public data plus a model equals an edge. Several candidates are parity with sophisticated clubs at best, and the set never shows a Cubs-specific bottleneck.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/47",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "BLINDSPOTS - Shared assumption: adoption by busy staff. None of the candidates describes how it would reach a decision-maker, or who is accountable when the tool is wrong.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/48",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "BLINDSPOTS - Shared failure modes: hindsight leakage in backtests, small samples, weak or missing baselines, survivorship bias, and measuring forecast accuracy rather than changed decisions or wins.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/49",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "BLINDSPOTS - Uncovered user groups and decisions: amateur draft and scouting, in-season pitching staff workload, defense and positioning, ticket and fan-facing operations, and business-side staff. Most candidates also focus on information tools rather than on coordination, data-entry burden or error prevention.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/50",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "BLINDSPOTS - Merge CALLUP_TRANSLATOR and MILB_CONTEXT_NORM into one baseline: a public-data translation model with walk-forward calibration, scored against raw-stat and public-projection baselines. Only if it beats those baselines would any added staff tooling be justified.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/51",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "OPP_BULLPEN - Start with a pre-registered forecast-only test, run as a spreadsheet, and record which Cubs decisions would have changed. Build software only if the forecast beats the naive rule and decisions change.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3/claim/52",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261008-143634-565a00716635/candidates/0/3",
          "kind": "UNKNOWN",
          "text": "BLINDSPOTS - cubs_internal_analytics_capabilities, existing_cubs_decision_review_process, and the rate at which each candidate decision recurs per season.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        }
