            "kind": "IDEA",
            "text": "Opponent bullpen availability forecast, where the manager and hitting coaches decide lineup order, platoon starts, and pinch-hit timing based on likely opposing relievers, using a model built from public box-score appearance and pitch-count history.",
            "status": "UNVERIFIED",
            "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
          }
        ],
